# Walkthrough: Cloud Sync, Recovery & Android App

I've implemented a robust **Cloud Sync** and **Security** system, and I've also prepared your project for **Android APK** installation!

## New Features

### 1. Android App (APK Generation)
- **Native Experience**: Your web app is now fully compatible with Android!
- **How to Get Your APK**:
    1.  Open **Android Studio**.
    2.  Select **"Open an Existing Project"** and choose the folder named `android` inside your project directory.
    3.  Wait for the build to finish (Gradle Sync).
    4.  Go to **Build → Build Bundle(s) / APK(s) → Build APK(s)**.
    5.  Once done, a notification will pop up. Click **"locate"** to find your `.apk` file and send it to your phone!

### 2. Secret Recovery Phrase (Forgot Password)
- **Safe Setup**: When you first set up your shop, you'll be asked for a **"Secret Recovery Phrase"**.
- **Self-Service Reset**: If you ever forget your password, click the **"Forgot Password?"** link on the login screen.
- **In-App Management**: Go to **Manage → Cloud** to set or change your phrase anytime while logged in.

### 3. Multi-Device Cloud Login
- **Access Anywhere**: Open your app link on any device.
- **Automatic Sync**: Once you log in, your products and sales records will automatically download from the cloud.
- **Real-Time backup**: Every change you make is saved to the cloud within 5 seconds automatically.

---

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Android Studio Required**: To generate the final APK file, you must have [Android Studio](https://developer.android.com/studio) installed on your computer.

